WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
*Silent Night plays*

00:00:29.960 --> 00:00:34.280
Narrator: T'was the night before Christmas, and all through the  house...

00:00:34.840 --> 00:00:39.200
Not a creature was stirring, not even a mouse...

00:00:43.240 --> 00:00:45.960
*Creeeeek Step Step Step*

00:00:47.960 --> 00:00:51.920
Stockings were hung by the chimney with care...

00:00:52.200 --> 00:00:56.760
In hopes that St. Nicholas soon would be there...

00:00:58.760 --> 00:01:00.960
(Turkey noises)

00:01:08.360 --> 00:01:12.420
When up on the roof there arose such a clatter...

00:01:12.420 --> 00:01:18.100
I sprang from my bed to see what was the matter...

00:01:19.200 --> 00:01:23.120
Away to the windows I flew like a flash,

00:01:23.560 --> 00:01:27.760
Tore open the shutters, and threw up the sash...

00:01:28.280 --> 00:01:32.160
As I drew in my head and was turning around...

00:01:33.000 --> 00:01:39.280
Down the chimney, St. Nicholas came with a bound...

00:01:39.560 --> 00:01:43.800
A wink of his eye, and a twist of his head...

00:01:44.200 --> 00:01:50.160
Soon gave me to know, I had everything to dread...

00:01:55.660 --> 00:02:00.560
He spoke not a word, but went straight to his work...

00:02:00.840 --> 00:02:06.280
And filled all the stockings, then turned with a jerk...

00:02:06.600 --> 00:02:11.980
But I heard him exclaim, 'ere he drove out of sight

00:02:11.980 --> 00:02:14.820
Santa (creepily): Ho, ho, ho...

00:02:15.680 --> 00:02:18.480
Narrator: Merry Christmas to all...

00:02:19.440 --> 00:02:24.000
And to all a good night...

